    {
      "ts": 1786439573069,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Now I understand the setup. The default solver uses GPU and 4000 iterations — I'll need to modify it for CPU and 500 iterations. Let me first build Caffe. I'll use CMake with CPU-only, and disable OpenCV (Caffe 1.0 predates OpenCV 4 and CIFAR-10 LMDB doesn't need it) and Python to minimize build issues."
    },
    {
      "ts": 1786439573069,
      "type": "tool_start",
      "call": {
        "call_id": "call_762d5dcd9cf44f80892b89ab",
        "name": "bash",
        "input": {
          "command": "protoc --version 2>&1; echo \"---\"; dpkg -l | grep -E 'libprotobuf-dev|protobuf-compiler' | awk '{print $2,$3}'; echo \"---boost---\"; dpkg -l | grep libboost-dev | awk '{print $2,$3}'"
        }
      }
    },
    {
